{
 "_about": "MikroDash's Apps Usage catalogue, hand-curated. ORDER IS PRIORITY: when one address carries names of two apps, the earlier app wins, so specific apps come before the companies that host them (umbrella entries last). cmd/appgen expands `lists` from v2fly/domain-list-community and takes each `icon` from its source (simple-icons, gilbarbara, or the Iconify packages cib, arcticons and lucide) at the pinned versions below; `domains` are added by hand; `color` overrides the logo source's brand colour or supplies one where there is no logo. Edit this file, then run cmd/appgen.",
